EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Dear {!Contact.FirstName} {!Contact.LastName},

Thank you for contacting the ASU Salesforce Support Team.  We have received your email and are working on responding to you as soon as possible.

If you are current Salesforce user with access to Case records, you can also view the status of your Case, add further information, and follow your Support Case.

Case Number: {!Case.CaseNumber}
Subject: {!Case.Subject}

Click here to view your case in Salesforce.


If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
